[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
veil reads %%PREFIX%%/etc/veil/config.toml. The default one serves
%%DATADIR%%/www on http://127.0.0.1:8080/ (plaintext HTTP/1.1 and h2c),
drops privileges to www and enters capability mode (capsicum).

  sysrc veil_enable=YES
  service veil start
  curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/

Edit the configuration and run `service veil reload`.
Documentation: https://github.com/aofusa/veil-proxy/blob/main/docs/guide/running.md
EOM
}
]
